00:07:01.576 --> 00:07:05.608
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:11.920
<v Slow>新しいビルは、どこにオープンしましたか。

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.879
<v Host>In front of Tokyo Station.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:21.096
<v Slow>ビルの高さは、約何メートルですか。

00:07:21.896 --> 00:07:25.591
<v Host>About two hundred fifty meters — fifty-one floors.

00:07:26.192 --> 00:07:32.000
<v Slow>地下のバスターミナルは、どうなる予定ですか。

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:36.423
<v Host>It is planned to become the biggest bus terminal in Japan.

00:07:37.024 --> 00:07:46.360
<v Host>That's all for today. Next time you start a trip from Tokyo Station, you can have lunch at the new tower before your train or bus. See you next time!

00:07:46.959 --> 00:07:49.360
<v News>また明日。
